<title>AUSTRIA: TENNIS-AUSTRIA AND SOUTH AFRICA LEVEL 1-1.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-AUSTRIA AND SOUTH AFRICA LEVEL 1-1.</headline>
<dateline>POERTSCHACH, Austria 1997-07-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austria and South</p>
<p>Africa were level 1-1 after the opening singles on the first day</p>
<p>of their Fed Cup, Group two play-off tie on Saturday.</p>
<p>Results:</p>
<p>Barbara Paulus (Austria) beat Joannette Kruger (South Africa)</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>Amanda Coetzer (South Africa) beat Barbara Schett (Austria) 6-1</p>
<p>7-6 7-5</p>
</text>
